WEBVTT

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:03.310
The "Asaohyou Hyou" Mushroom...

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:05.210
...a.k.a. the "Mushroom of Truth!"

00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:09.130
One bite of this, and you won't be able to hide your innermost, true feelings.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:13.870
Ayukawa...

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:24.110
It does me no good to discover your true feelings!

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:26.860
The bridge is dangerous!

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:30.150
I despise you with all my heart, Sempai!
Don't come closer!

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:48.960
As I tried to kiss you, as if to avoid me...

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:56.770
...with your T-Shirt on,
you dove into the shining sea...

00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:03.140
The white flower petals on your soaking skirt...

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:09.710
Spread open upon the surface of the blue water.

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:18.730
Tell me why, when you winked...

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:26.670
...to tell me that you'd be mine...

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:31.340
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
You're unpredictable...

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:34.640
'Tell me you love me, Tell me that you need me...

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:38.550
Tell Me, Tell Me,
...my Angel of the Summer...

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:41.150
'Tell me, lover, Tell me that you need me...

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:45.690
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
I know that you're in love...

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:49.090
'Tell me you love me,
Tell me that you need me...

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:55.600
Tell Me, Tell Me - but you're a mystery.

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:08.030
Mystical Madoka!
The Mushrooms of 120% Truthfulness.

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:12.560
"Sempai!"
Mystical Madoka!
The Mushrooms of 120% Truthfulness.

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:17.740
"Darling!"

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:24.910
"Yeah! Dar..."

00:02:28.490 --> 00:02:30.150
"Hikaru."

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:33.120
"Darling...! Madoka...?"
"Hikaru."

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:37.370
"Thank you, Hikaru...
for coming to our ceremony."

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:40.790
"'Ceremony?' What do you mean,
'ceremony'?"

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.510
"Thank you, Hikaru."

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:46.930
"Thank you. We promise to live a happy life together."

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:49.650
"N...No!"

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:51.670
"Wait!"

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:59.660
"Darling!"

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:01.700
Darling...

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:05.620
Hikaru!

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:11.770
Darling!

00:03:11.770 --> 00:03:14.800
Darling! Darling!

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:17.770
Hikaru, we've arrived.
Darling! Darling!

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:40.110
We've come to an orienteering event, which includes mushroom-picking.

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:44.350
2... 3... 4... All accounted for, Master!

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:47.830
Okay! Then let's MOVE OUT!

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:54.350
...so these are the poison mushrooms.

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:57.690
Starting at this page are the
edible mushrooms, so pay attention.

00:03:57.690 --> 00:03:59.710
And then there's...

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:04.790
...the "Asaohyou Hyou" Mushroom...

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:06.460
...a.k.a. the "Mushroom of Truth!"

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:08.710
The "Mushroom of Truth?!"

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:14.160
Right. A strange fungus that only appears
once a decade, it's said.

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:18.680
One bite of this, and you won't be able to hide your innermost, true feelings.

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:19.660
Do you believe that?

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:21.630
I wonder!
Do you believe that?

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:25.130
Is that for real?

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:29.550
Well, I've never eaten one myself...

00:04:29.550 --> 00:04:31.990
Still, this year happens to be the tenth year.

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:33.470
Who knows, you might come across one.

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:36.660
If... If it's really true...

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:40.330
If the person who eats the mushroom had feelings for someone...

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:42.650
Well, all their innermost secrets would probably be revealed!

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:50.400
All righty then, let's organize into pairs and orienteer.

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:51.860
How should we choose them?

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:53.330
Here! Here! Here!
How should we choose them?

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:53.420
How should we choose them?

00:04:53.420 --> 00:04:55.050
We recommend boy-girl pairs!

00:04:55.330 --> 00:05:00.290
Well, I thought that we'd be doing this,
so I made lottery sticks.

00:05:11.050 --> 00:05:14.100
"Listen, if there's a lottery...
pick the longest stick, okay?"

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:15.750
"Huh? What're you talking about?"

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:16.620
"Just do it."
"Huh? What're you talking about?"

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:16.710
"Huh? What're you talking about?"

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:20.380
"It's the one with the red tip. The red tip."

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:32.660
Hikaru... I'm sorry!

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:37.400
Okay, my turn!

00:05:38.510 --> 00:05:39.960
Darling!

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:46.490
We truly are bound together by the red thread of destiny!

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:49.780
Oh! Thank goodness!

00:05:57.360 --> 00:05:59.510
Say, Darling?

00:05:59.510 --> 00:06:03.410
Er... Well... What I mean is...

00:06:03.410 --> 00:06:06.280
No matter what, I'm gonna find the Mushroom of Truth...

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:09.260
...so when I do, would you please have a bite, Darling?

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:12.630
W...Well, yeah... But why...?

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:14.570
Because...

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:19.740
How should I put it...

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:24.480
The thing is, I already know what your true feelings toward me are, but...

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:31.880
Who could guess that we were
bound together by a yellow thread?!

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:34.480
Oh, yeah! May I carry your things for you?

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:35.530
No thanks.

00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:38.000
Oh...?
No thanks.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:38.090
No thanks.

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:41.350
Oh, are you sure?

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:45.890
Er..."Because this is the way you really feel, you say...

00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:48.520
"'We celebrate the Mushroom on this late Autumn day.'

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:50.820
"--- by Seiji."

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:52.990
Wait, won't you please?!

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:57.370
My! You sure are reserved today, much more than usual!

00:06:57.370 --> 00:07:00.300
Really? That part of you is
what's so mysterious, yet...

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:02.980
...still, it tickles the hearts of men!

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:08.630
Is that it? You don't have any principles, do you?

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:16.190
Nah! I left 'em behind with my mother as I was being delivered!

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:18.740
Why don't you go back and get 'em then?

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:22.250
That big mouth thinks she can talk...

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.490
She thinks she's fresh or something!

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:27.290
Just watch! As soon as I find the Mushroom of Truth...

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:28.700
...I'll make her eat 'til she begs for mercy...

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:31.350
...and find out exactly what she's about!

00:07:35.090 --> 00:07:35.160
Rub-Rub...

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:36.490
H...Hey, now wait a second!
Rub-Rub...

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:36.580
Rub-Rub...

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:38.890
Kurumi, you're so adorable!

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:42.380
I'm gonna tell Manami what you just said!

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:46.460
I'll settle for either one of you.
Twins are basically interchangeable!

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:50.860
M...My mistake! I like Kurumi. I don't like Manami. Okay?

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:54.590
S...Say, I'd devour
Mushrooms of Truth for you, so...

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:57.260
...hear what I've really got to say from the bottom of my heart!

00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:59.280
"Hear no evil!"

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:10.260
If you really wanna eat them that much!

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:35.740
Constipated... or what?

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:42.650
Thanks!

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:51.420
I'll find the Mushroom of Truth,
no matter what!

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:52.570
Why?

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:54.560
Wh... What do you mean, "why?"

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:58.850
If you want it to use on Hikaru, then you're wasting your time!

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:01.760
Hikaru is one of those people who's always truthful about everything.

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:04.560
You could say that she's
a walking Mushroom of Truth!

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:10.570
Come to think of it, that's right. She's pure and innocent, so...

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:13.020
Well, you're free to interpret that
any way you want...

00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:15.240
Then, as far as Hikaru is concerned...

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:17.900
...it's completely useless to rely on such a thing.

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:22.810
Geez! But even so,
I keep trying to find the darn thing...

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:24.540
...the darn thing...

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:25.530
...that's right here.

00:09:25.530 --> 00:09:27.090
What?!
...that's right here.

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:31.770
Wow! It's pretty!

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:38.490
I know! I'm gonna munch it myself!

00:09:38.490 --> 00:09:40.330
Oh! That might be a good idea!

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:42.990
Just be straightforward and let her know how you feel...

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:47.250
...and maybe Hikaru will see you in a different light, y'know!

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:50.260
Right!

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:59.440
Okay!

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:00.730
No! No! Watch out!
Okay!

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:13.920
Listen to me!
This bridge is old and dangerous!

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.750
You see this? It says so right here!

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:16.120
You see this? It says so right here!
"Keep off - Do not cross"

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:16.190
"Keep off - Do not cross"

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:20.190
Understand?
You don't go past signs like this!
"Keep off - Do not cross"

00:10:20.190 --> 00:10:21.680
"Keep off - Do not cross"

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:26.480
I've got to... do something about Ayukawa's misunderstanding...

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:29.590
Darling! Have you found the mushroom yet?

00:10:29.590 --> 00:10:32.980
Huh? Oh! N... Er... Not yet.

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:36.000
I...I'm gonna try looking for them this way.

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:39.820
Darling!

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:44.280
Darling, I found it! I betcha this is the one!

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:47.980
Huh...?

00:10:57.060 --> 00:10:59.370
A...Ayukawa!

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:03.490
I...I'm sorry! I wanted to apologize for what happened earlier!

00:11:20.480 --> 00:11:23.880
Ka-su-ga.

00:11:24.890 --> 00:11:26.860
A...Ayukawa...

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:40.940
Ayukawa must've... Ayukawa
must have eaten the mushroom...

00:11:40.940 --> 00:11:42.970
Why else would she be doing this to me?!

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:48.900
Ayukawa!

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:05.490
Ayukawa, are you all right?!

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:30.110
You'll be fine!

00:12:40.060 --> 00:12:43.030
Thank you... Kasuga.

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:23.230
Hikaru!

00:13:23.230 --> 00:13:24.580
Gotcha.

00:13:24.850 --> 00:13:28.730
A-ha! Found it! Found it!
Found it! Here it is!

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:32.020
With this much, I can discover
everyone's true feelings at the same time!

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:37.720
There! Oh, 'tis such a magnificent aroma!

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:51.920
I... I know I fool around too much, telling lame jokes every day.

00:13:51.920 --> 00:13:55.990
The truth... the truth is that I'm the main tragic figure here!

00:13:55.990 --> 00:13:58.590
I... I've kept it a secret from everyone, but...

00:13:58.590 --> 00:14:00.530
...I'm suffering from a serious illness!

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:03.550
I don't know how many days I've got left!

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:09.720
Just look at this fingertip!

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:12.130
Look!

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:15.070
I clipped the nail too closely three days ago. Urk!

00:14:15.070 --> 00:14:17.320
I clipped the nail too closely three days ago. Urk!

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:21.550
And... I've got dandruff,
my back teeth are full of cavities...

00:14:21.550 --> 00:14:25.220
...I've got gingivitis, I'm overweight, and I suffer from athlete's foot!

00:14:25.220 --> 00:14:27.690
S...So that poor powerless Hatta can live for another day...

00:14:27.690 --> 00:14:30.710
...gimme a hand, show your love, please!

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:36.630
What a poor soul am I!

00:14:36.630 --> 00:14:39.810
No one in the world is more tragic than I am! "Rollin', Rollin'!"

00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:45.310
Huh...?

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:50.320
I wonder if Hikaru's eaten
one of the mushrooms I concocted...?

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:13.890
Hikaru... I've just eaten the Mushroom of Truth!

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:18.710
Please hear of my true feelings for you!

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:22.290
Hearing your true feelings won't do me any good!

00:15:24.600 --> 00:15:27.750
My... My true feelings are...

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:29.770
My...

00:15:32.480 --> 00:15:36.050
I... I... I've always had...

00:15:36.050 --> 00:15:37.890
I've always...

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:42.910
...had feelings for you, Hikaru!

00:15:49.430 --> 00:15:52.660
Stop kidding around with me! Idiot!

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:55.840
Now I know what kind of a person you really are!

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:58.870
That's how you felt about me, isn't it?!

00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:05.810
Hikaru...

00:16:07.310 --> 00:16:10.280
...slapped me but good!

00:16:12.980 --> 00:16:17.110
F...Four times to boot!
Guess she hates me now!

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:20.130
What happened to you?! My goodness!

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:23.090
You laughed your way through
a love confession?! What an oddball!

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:40.280
There! Done.

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:41.450
Thank you for everything.
There! Done.

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:43.480
Master! Big trouble!
Thank you for everything.

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:49.120
Hikaru's trying to cross that suspension bridge!

00:16:49.490 --> 00:16:50.510
What?!

00:16:50.510 --> 00:16:52.560
Master, show me where this "suspension bridge" is!

00:16:57.260 --> 00:16:58.500
Ushiko.

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:00.460
Umao!
Ushiko.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.650
Wherefore art thou, Ushiko?

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:06.880
And, wherefore art thou, Umao?

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:10.000
"And, wherefore art my apples?"

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:14.210
I've got to borrow this...!

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:31.380
Hikaru, come back!
The bridge is too dangerous!

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:35.420
Sempai, I can't stand you anymore! Don't come near me, please!

00:17:51.350 --> 00:17:53.320
Come on, Hikaru!

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:02.810
Here. Eat this!

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:04.780
Th... That's...

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:07.280
I... came across it.

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:11.410
Using this... I'd like to hear what your true feelings for me are!

00:18:11.410 --> 00:18:14.370
If I eat it... will you go back?

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:32.520
Sempai!

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:33.720
Don't panic!
Sempai!

00:18:33.720 --> 00:18:33.810
Sempai!

00:18:33.810 --> 00:18:36.240
We'll cross by holding onto the rope!

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:37.130
Don't panic!

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:39.090
S...Sure...
Don't panic!

00:18:53.310 --> 00:18:54.890
Sempai!

00:18:54.890 --> 00:18:57.590
Hikaru... don't look down!

00:18:57.590 --> 00:18:59.500
Okay...

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:02.550
Somebody! Is there anybody around?!

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:25.870
S...Should I use the Power?!

00:19:29.380 --> 00:19:32.730
No... Not yet.

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:36.270
Somebody! Is there anybody around?!

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:44.690
Ayukawa!

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:46.090
Madoka!
Ayukawa!

00:19:54.570 --> 00:19:57.270
Hikaru! Hold on tight!

00:19:57.270 --> 00:19:57.900
Okay!
Hikaru! Hold on tight!

00:19:59.140 --> 00:20:01.110
C'mon!

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:06.460
Hikaru, I'll tell you the truth...

00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:09.480
What I... really feel...

00:21:10.880 --> 00:21:14.090
No... It's not necessary.
Because, I feel like...

00:21:14.090 --> 00:21:16.350
...I already know
how you really feel about me.

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:21.420
Oh... I see...

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:31.600
Huh...?

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:33.800
What's wrong?
Huh...?

00:21:36.970 --> 00:21:37.840
Why, that's...

00:21:37.840 --> 00:21:39.470
There's a bitemark.
Why, that's...

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:39.560
Why, that's...

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:41.610
What?! Then...

00:21:47.650 --> 00:21:50.350
Cute.

00:21:51.490 --> 00:21:54.600
Kasuga... I love you...

00:21:54.600 --> 00:21:56.660
H...Hey!

00:22:00.430 --> 00:22:02.470
When I was with Ayukawa earlier...

00:22:02.470 --> 00:22:06.090
...she was acting weird
because of the mushroom.

00:22:10.270 --> 00:22:14.970
Sempai! Madoka! Hurry, hurry!

00:22:18.280 --> 00:22:20.890
Oh, what a pitiful soul I am!

00:22:20.890 --> 00:22:23.670
What a pitiful soul I am!

00:22:23.670 --> 00:22:26.870
I'm worried that they'll never get back to normal.

00:22:26.870 --> 00:22:28.800
About those mushrooms, well you see...

00:22:28.800 --> 00:22:33.110
...if you get bit by something, the effect wears off.

00:22:33.110 --> 00:22:37.630
Tell the truth now.
How in the world do you know that?

00:22:37.970 --> 00:22:42.560
'Cause! The mushrooms were just something that I conc...

00:22:43.070 --> 00:22:45.560
So it's all your fault, eh?!

00:22:45.560 --> 00:22:46.880
Oh! I'm sorry!

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:48.840
Hey! Kurumi!
Oh! I'm sorry!

00:22:51.450 --> 00:22:52.830
"About those mushrooms, well you see...

00:22:52.830 --> 00:22:55.850
"If you get bit by something, the effect wears off."

00:23:00.620 --> 00:23:02.670
What?! Th...Then...

00:23:02.670 --> 00:23:04.630
...after you got bitten by the snake...

00:23:08.830 --> 00:23:11.800
A...Ayukawa!

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:40.560
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:44.820
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:23:44.820 --> 00:23:49.150
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:23:49.150 --> 00:23:53.390
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:23:53.390 --> 00:24:01.260
On that last night we went out for a drive,
I left my go-out voice behind.

00:24:01.260 --> 00:24:10.770
As we watched the horizon, I said good-bye.

00:24:10.770 --> 00:24:18.580
Like seasons, hit songs come and go...
As you get used to one, you're tired of it...

00:24:18.580 --> 00:24:27.250
That's what's written on your profile.

00:24:27.250 --> 00:24:36.960
You were waiting for the lucky star in your room...

00:24:36.960 --> 00:24:45.340
...I was too late to notice it in that one phone call that day.

00:24:45.340 --> 00:24:49.680
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:24:49.680 --> 00:24:54.010
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:24:54.010 --> 00:24:58.320
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:24:58.320 --> 00:25:02.660
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:25:02.660 --> 00:25:07.480
Erase the memory of you from me...
"Stop, Stop, Stop."

00:25:12.790 --> 00:25:15.200
Long time no see, Grandpa!

00:25:15.200 --> 00:25:18.390
These are Ayukawa and Hikaru, two friends I've brought along.

00:25:18.390 --> 00:25:22.040
By the way, about the Power,
I'm keeping it a secret from them.

00:25:22.040 --> 00:25:25.830
Oh! Use your hands when serving the tea!

00:25:26.640 --> 00:25:30.570
Next time: "Roots Panic!
Madoka in the Mysterious Homeland."
